<===> README.md
In compressed output, an attribute selector modifier directly follows a
quoted value (`[b="c d"i]`), but needs a space after an identifier value
(`[b=c i]`), like dart-sass.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> modifiers/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> modifiers/input.scss
a[b="c d" i] {x: y}
a[b=c i] {x: y}
a[b="c" s] {x: y}
a[b="--c" i] {x: y}
a[b="c d"] {x: y}
a[b] {x: y}
a[b|=c] {x: y}
<===> modifiers/output.css
a[b="c d"i]{x:y}a[b=c i]{x:y}a[b=c s]{x:y}a[b="--c"i]{x:y}a[b="c d"]{x:y}a[b]{x:y}a[b|=c]{x:y}
